* From C. L. Baker, "JOSS: Scenario of a Filmed Report", RAND RM-4162-PR, June 1964: the film of 21 March 1964, pages 8 and 9 and examples 4 and 5.
! joss 1964
1.1 Page.
1.2 Type form 1.
Form 1:
 P      L       M
1.3 Do part 2 for p = 81, 72, 45, 9.
2.1 Line.
2.2 Do part 3 for L = .1, .2(.2)2.
3.1 Set m = -2.5·k·log[cos(p/c)·.64/sqrt(.5)/L*2].
3.2 Type p, L, m in form 2.
Form 2:
__    _.__   -_.__
Set c = 180/3.14159265.
Set k = 1/log(10).
Do part 1.
Type all.
